PASS: 12 clothing, 4 weapons, 6 powerups, 14 perk definitions; 10 numeric fixtures.
Screened 256 gear loadouts, 500 conditional subsets, 7500 combined states across 15 legal powerup combinations.
Ranges: dps_proxy=0.600000..1.690000; ehp_ratio=0.840000..1.485000; dash_duration_s=0.141732..0.250000; primary_range=1.800000..2.300000; followup_range=2.790000..3.565000; followup_damage_ratio=0.750000..1.550000; followup_cooldown_s=0.346154..0.642857
Numeric peak models cover PERK-01/02/03; other unassigned perk definitions receive structural checks only.
Limitations: unassigned perk effects, event/cooldown/gesture timing, ammo uptime, area-hit opportunities and human balance are not simulated; DPS proxies and budgets are screening guardrails, not proof of balance.
